   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "An action in progress",
     "texto": [
      "To say an action is happening right now (like English «I am reading»), use **être en train de + infinitive**: **Je suis en train de lire** (I am reading).",
      "Conjugate **être** and leave the second verb in the infinitive: **Tu es en train de travailler**, **Nous sommes en train de manger**.",
      "It is a useful form, but not compulsory: the present tense can also express an action happening now, depending on the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
